💭 A matrix generic over the numbers conforming to 📈, specialized for 🔢, 💯 and 💧.

🕊 🎛🐚T 📈🐚T🍆🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 values 🍨🐚T🍆
  🖍🆕 rows 🔢
  🖍🆕 columns 🔢

  🆕 🍼 rows 🔢 🍼 columns 🔢 fill T 🍇
    🆕🍨🐚T🍆 fill rows ✖️ columns❗️ ➡️ 🖍values
  🍉

  ❓ 📊 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ columns
  🍉

  ❗️ 📍 row 🔢 column 🔢 ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ 🐽values row ✖️ columns ➕ column❗️
  🍉

  🖍❗️ 📌 value T row 🔢 column 🔢 🍇
    value ➡️ 🐽values row ✖️ columns ➕ column❗️
  🍉

  💭 The product of this matrix and *other*. Starting each sum with its first term needs no zero of T.
  ✖️ other 🎛🐚T🍆 ➡️ 🎛🐚T🍆 🍇
    🆕🎛🐚T🍆 rows 📊other❓ 📍👇 0 0❗️❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕 result
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 rows❗️ 🍇
      🔂 j 🆕⏩ 0 📊other❓❗️ 🍇
        📍👇 i 0❗️ ✖️ 📍other 0 j❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕 sum
        🔂 k 🆕⏩ 1 columns❗️ 🍇
          sum ⬅️➕ 📍👇 i k❗️ ✖️ 📍other k j❗️
        🍉
        📌result sum i j❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ result
  🍉

  ❗️ 🖨 describe 🍇T➡️🔡🍉 🍇
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 rows❗️ 🍇
      🔂 j 🆕⏩ 0 columns❗️ 🍇
        😀 ⁉️describe 📍👇 i j❗️❗️❗️
      🍉
    🍉
  🍉
🍉

🕊 🧰 🍇
  🆕 🍇🍉

  💭 The largest of *values*, compared with 📈's ▶️.
  🐇❗️ 🔝🐚T 📈🐚T🍆🍆 values 🍨🐚T🍆 ➡️ T 🍇
    🐽values 0❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕 largest
    🔂 value values 🍇
      ↪️ value ▶️ largest 🍇
        value ➡️ 🖍largest
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ largest
  🍉
